ABOUT THIS FILE

Apache-2.0 clause 4(d) asks that a NOTICE file, where one exists, be
carried into derivative works. So this file holds attributions and
nothing else. It is not a changelog, it is not a licence, and it is not
a description of the project.


WHAT IS IN THE REPOSITORY

Documentation and process, plus the Python package under tools/. No
third-party source code is vendored and no third-party asset is
bundled.

The repository cites 504 external sources by evidence id. Each id
resolves to a row in registry/evidence.json carrying that source's
title, url, version, access date and the licence recorded for it.
Findings are restated in this repository's own words, and attribution
is carried at the point of use by evidence id. That is why most of the
504 are not named again below: nothing of their wording is here.


ATTRIBUTION WHERE A LICENCE ASKS FOR IT

The provenance sweep of 2026-08-10 read the whole read surface of
twenty packs and recorded, per pack, what is carried from a source and
under what licence. A source is named below where its licence
conditions reuse on attribution and the sweep found its terms, its list
or its wording carried.

